---------------------------------------------------------------------
PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
21-turn game. Beicon's Pengullet/Elphidran Aqua chip damage early (Cayde 10->8->6, some Lucky Pal cancels). Relaxaurus destroyed by Cayde's Cryolinx-interrupt-then-Strike-from-Darkness combo (turn 9, self-sacrifice for tempo). Beicon's Elphidran traded/destroyed Cayde's Elphidran Aqua and Elphidran across turns 10-12 (via Elphidran Aqua Dragon-reveal +500 power, then Penking finishing). Beicon deployed Jormuntide (1600) destroying Cayde's Relaxaurus (turn 13), then chip-attacked Cayde repeatedly with Jormuntide (3 dmg, several Lucky-Pal-cancelled) and Pengullet/Menasting (2 dmg each) grinding Cayde from 8->6->4->2. A Pengullet explode-skill self-wipe (1300 to own board) reset Beicon's board turn 15. Cayde's own Jormuntide Ignis destroyed a Beicon Pengullet (turn 17) and later traded with Beicon's Menasting via Retaliate (both destroyed, turn 21) before Beicon's remaining Jormuntide hit Cayde for the final 3 (2 to 0).


